# Run r1103 slice A, boot 1: OLD PACK world (deploy/latest = release 1.1.06 full install: patcherMod 1.1.04, standalone
# More Mooblooms, Baby Mobs, Canned Goods, Golden Food, Salt, Create: The Salt; Creative Delight under its old id).
# Group A superflat, level sAo; setup in sA_setup.md "Boot 1". The world carries into boots 2 and 3 (new jars).
# Only setup halves here (row ids end in "o"): what the queue's "boot 1 on the old jars" / "old world" rows need saved.
# No /zq (the current probe loads Creative Calendar classes, absent in 1.1.06): vanilla commands, clone counts and
# perfBot only. Home: marker tagged sahome at world spawn, capture SAH (y = SAH2 = air above the superflat grass).
# Sites (offsets from SAH): golems x+10..+12 z+10; cakes x+20..+22 z+10; Golden chests x+20 / x+23 z+14; End plants
# x+30..+36 z+10, dishes chest x+30 z+14; mooshroom pen x+40..+46 z+8..+14; cows x+50 z+10; village x+160;
# End House at -30 ~ 30 in the End.
pace 2

## SA1-00 | setup: home marker, clock, weather (not a queue row)
bootexpect Done \(
> execute unless entity @e[type=minecraft:marker,tag=sahome] run summon minecraft:marker ~ ~ ~ {Tags:["sahome"]}
sleep 2
> data get entity @e[type=minecraft:marker,tag=sahome,limit=1] Pos
capture SAH entity data: \[(-?\d+)\.\d+d, (-?\d+)\.\d+d, (-?\d+)\.\d+d\]
> gamerule doDaylightCycle false
> time set noon
> gamerule doWeatherCycle false
> weather clear 1000000
> gamerule doPatrolSpawning false
> gamerule doTraderSpawning false
> gamerule doInsomnia false
> say SA1 setup done
expect SA1 setup done
shell grep -m1 -oE "creativeengineering-1\.1\.[0-9]+\.jar" logs/latest.log logs/debug.log | head -1; ls mods | grep -iE "^(creativeengineering|creative_delight|CannedGoods|goldenfood|salt-|create_salt|moreMooblooms|babyMobs|creativeworldgen)"
